CHANGE SCOPE LIMITER

Small → 1 file
Medium → ≤5 files
Large → confirmation required

For behavior-changing code:

Small → test file + implementation file is acceptable
Medium → related tests + ≤5 implementation files
Large → confirmation required before broad changes

Do not expand the scope of implementation beyond the test-backed behavior.

